{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01938",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 6.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Morning, come on through. Right, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.71,
      "end_seconds": 15.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Um, honestly, it's difficulty breathing, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.03,
      "end_seconds": 19.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.41,
      "end_seconds": 22.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "It's been ten days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.22,
      "end_seconds": 29.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.43,
      "end_seconds": 33.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.03,
      "end_seconds": 37.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.0,
      "end_seconds": 49.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Mm, when it starts I tend to get belly pain as well. As for belly pain, it's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.54,
      "end_seconds": 52.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you been feeling faint?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.04,
      "end_seconds": 62.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Mm, yes. Okay, so as for feeling faint, I'd call it moderate. It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.87,
      "end_seconds": 77.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.88,
      "end_seconds": 90.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.5,
      "text": "Warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening. Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. Mm, though honestly, some days I forget to take it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.53,
      "end_seconds": 104.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.36,
      "end_seconds": 112.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.92,
      "end_seconds": 114.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.36,
      "end_seconds": 117.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.95,
      "end_seconds": 127.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Alright, an irregular heartbeat, that matches what I have here. Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.63,
      "end_seconds": 136.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "I'm allergic to plasters, I get a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.42,
      "end_seconds": 140.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.01,
      "end_seconds": 144.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.73,
      "end_seconds": 147.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 159.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.9,
      "end_seconds": 162.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "How about loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.91,
      "end_seconds": 168.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "No, none, no loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.8,
      "end_seconds": 173.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Have you noticed neck pain or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.94,
      "end_seconds": 179.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I, I haven't had neck pain or head injury, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.8,
      "end_seconds": 183.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.0,
      "end_seconds": 187.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.14,
      "end_seconds": 201.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.6,
      "end_seconds": 211.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.67,
      "end_seconds": 228.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 92 beats a minute, temperature is 36.8 degrees, blood pressure 97 over 63."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.48,
      "end_seconds": 235.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.5,
      "end_seconds": 238.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.43,
      "end_seconds": 242.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.09,
      "end_seconds": 257.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "There is bruising across the chest, the left side moves less, and the belly is tender and rigid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.43,
      "end_seconds": 276.49,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards serious chest and abdominal injury. Internal bleeding is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.2,
      "end_seconds": 283.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.38,
      "end_seconds": 306.09,
      "duration_seconds": 20.71,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with serious chest and abdominal injury do well once it's treated properly. I'll request a trauma CT scan, it'll help with major trauma. Do not move, I am activating the trauma team now. I'll want another look straight away. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.63,
      "end_seconds": 310.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.61,
      "end_seconds": 312.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}